SUMMARY:Saint James Voices
DESCRIPTION:An intergenerational Sunday choir led by Kate Umble Smucker\, the ensemble is open to anyone age nine and above\, with no experience required. The group rehearses at 9:00 AM on the 4th Sunday of each month\, then sings at the 10:30 AM Mass. Click here to email Kate if you’d like the music in advance of the rehearsal.
